{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん\nひなぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/11/10/1068411/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に温かいコメント嬉しいです><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"重大発表があります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってのは嘘です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"重大発表って題名だったから\nひなめろさんびっくりしたでしょっ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「重大発表ってなんだ？！」\n「川後どうした？！」\nってなったでしょ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違いますよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/11/10/1068411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さんの話のことです笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待機して23:00ぴったしに\n戸賀崎さんからの重大発表みたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが言いたかったんです(｢･ω･)｢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキドキしながらみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/11/10/1068411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペナントレースというものが\n始まるみたいですね(｢･ω･)｢！！\n明日はドラフト会議だし\n凄いわくわくしている自分がいます..!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"+++"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、初のグラビア撮影でした☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳細は、楽しみに待っててね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい楽しく撮影しました...!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやく見てもらいたい..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/11/10/1068411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"+++"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、りなとディズニー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/11/10/1068411/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マリーちゃんの耳と\nセーラー服でお揃いコーデ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/11/10/1068411/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シー行ったけど、\nイクスピアリ行ったりもしたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2時間ほど、眠たりもした。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある意味、\nまったり出来て良き日だったの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"+++"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～とりあえず、\nかんなちゃん可愛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/11/10/1068411/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、\n九州のアイドルグループレベル高いね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/11/10/1068411/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2013/11/10/1068411/0008.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}